  "details": "There should be an option to invert view for Xbox controller users. \n\nI've been playing with streaming VRChat to my phone and using an Xbox controller to play with it since VRChat added support for it. This works great tbh. Except one drastic oversight. There's no ability to invert the view for controller users. \n\nThere's currently the option to invert mouse in the menu. But if this is already checked, it does not invert controller. When a Xbox controller is detected, the bindings menu changes to a Xbox controller layout and there is no checkbox for invert view. \n\nWhile there may not be many Xbox controller users currently, when VRChat finally comes to Android devices, this control scheme may become much more popular because of how well it works with mobile phones, hopefully this simple change can find its way into the game before the mobile release.",
